e same width through the base.","outcome":"On May 3, 2022 it closed at $25.99, its first close above the base high of $25.71. Volume that day was 5.7M shares, 1.46x the prior 10-day average of 3.9M. It didn't hold. By May 11, 2022 it had closed below the breakout level three days running, and the chart ends at $22.19.","lesson":"This is an example of a failed breakout where everything looked right, volume included, and the stock fell back anyway. It happens. This is why traders cut losses fast instead of hoping."}}